. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * We estimate a linear regression of our measure of gender equality o
> n having at least one daughter since the year before the survey, net of compr
> ehensive sex-specific FE
. 
.         global controls i.age#i.sex i.syear#i.sex i.nkids_now#i.sex i.edu_lev
> el#i.sex i.corigin_nm#i.sex

.         reghdfe hours_chores d_daughter daughter_male if partner_dummy==1, ab
> sorb($controls) cluster(i.hid)
